  m_Name: Dialogue4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Combat Guide
  lines: "\"The castle guards are right ahead! Before you charge in, make sure your
    skills are sharp.\"\n\"Use the arrow keys to move across the courtyard and position
    yourself.\"\n\"Press Space to strike at the demon's minions before they overwhelm
    you.\"\n\"Watch their movements and press Q to raise your guard and block incoming
    blows or R to dogde their blows\"\n\"Defeat every last guard blocking the entrance\u2014once
    the courtyard is clear, the castle doors will be yours to breach!\""
  requiredProgress: 0
